    </div>
  `).join('')}
</div>

<h3>Kibana 追溯信息</h3>
<div class="kibana-trace">
  <p><strong>告警UUID:</strong> <code class="inline">${escapeHtml(reportData.alert_summary?.alert_uuid || 'N/A')}</code></p>
  <p><strong>直接链接:</strong> <a href="${escapeHtml(reportData.alert_summary?.kibana_url || '#')}" class="link">点击跳转</a></p>
  <p><strong>查询条件:</strong> <code class="inline">kibana.alert.uuid: "${escapeHtml((reportData.alert_summary?.alert_uuid || '').substring(0, 43))}"</code></p>
